U D 0~
maiden blood~
the &08Maiden of Blood&00~
A &08scarlet-eyed maiden&00 snarls in vicious fury
~
It is said that the Maiden of Blood is descended of a union between the Master
of the Night, who fell in lust upon a mortal woman of great, but undeveloped,
powers.  The Maiden was born with enormous talent and none to teach it to her.
Consequently she used it for great ill, rousing the forces of purity to strive
against her.  She has great powers over negative matter, the decay of nature,
and undead, which she has used to craft artifacts of cruelty for her servants.
  
~
