C D 0~
hazy form massive orc smoke~
the &07Orc of the Smoke&00~
&07The hazy form of a massive orc hovers over the ground&00
~
This nameless orc was one of the test subjects for the less scrupulous magi
developing the Smoke of Knowledge.  The early forms that the smoke took
were unstable, transforming a weak, battered orc into a barely containable
force of malevolence.  He was persuaded by the Maiden of Blood to join her
forces, by her promises of wealth and carnage.
~
