H P 0~
alabaster nobleman ravenwing sunless duke~
&21The Sunless Duke&00~
&00An &14alabaster fleshed &00nobleman with ravenwing hair flashes dark glances.
~
Unsubstantiated rumors abound as to how the gentle Duke Helarion became the
sun fearing madman that he is.  Some claim that it was that his beloved
Duchess Armorrine abandoned him for another.  Others claim that it was her
death that caused him to seek the path of death in life.  Still more say
that it was initially a harmless allergy, amplified as he avoided the sun
more and more, until the slightest burn caused him agony.

Regardless, it is certain that he drains the heat and energy of his
victims, leaving them cold and pallid should they live, and withered husks
should they die.
~
