death's nymph~
&05Death's Nymph&00~
&05A lusciously curved nymph with nacreous hair and slate eyes undulates here.&00
~
Once a delicate forest creature named Calandra, she caught the eye of the
ruler of the underworld, who corrupted her from the fair, golden haired and
azure eyed faerie she once was, into the hard eyed, rippling black haired
vamp she is now.  She is known only as Death's Nymph, and her presence is a
sign of despair.
~
