U T 0~
humanoid shadowy darkness lurk thief lore~
the &03Thief of Lore&00~
&03A humanoid cloaked in shadowy darkness lurks at the edge of vision.&00
~
She is now known as the Thief of Lore, but was once the Spring Sage,
serving with the other three servants of the gods placed to keep balance
between divinities and man.  The knowledge intoxicated her, replacing her
ethic of goodness and balance with a hunger for learning that could be sated
only by raiding the most private libraries.  The Maiden of Blood has
promised, and given, her the first choice of all writings that they capture,
a bargain that has pleased her well.  
~
