F P 0~
cloud fugitive creature roiling black~
&00The Cloud Fugitive&00~
&00A creature wreathed in roiling black cloud glares about malevolently.&00
~
Once one of the masters of storms, now in flight from the overworld kin
that the Cloud Fugitive once served with, he sought to cover the earth in
dense mist, defying the stars and sun, praising the dull silver of the
coated heavens.  Stripped of much power, he still retains some of his
abilities, and dreams that the spoils brought with the Maiden of Blood will
raise him to his old heights.
~
