The Autumn Sage is one of four powerful mages, gifted with incredible
longevity by the gods to serve as custodians of elemental magics and
keepers of the balance.  Her allies are equipped with the finest artifacts
that her powers allow, formed of the forces of the stars, earth and
elements, infused with great purity.
~
