The mighty illusionist &13Serac&00 curls his fingers about his mana.
~
Serac regards it as both an aesthetic challenge and a moral imperative to
use his illusionary skills to imprison and reform his enemies, rather than
destroying them.  However, he is not so fainthearted as to shy from killing
abominations such as the Maiden of Blood, a creature that clearly cannot be
purified.
~
