The &10golden haired&00 paladin Lionotil raises his weapon in readiness.
~
Lionotil has a gentle, sad countenance, hardened by the cruelties he has
fought against, though his soul has never bowed to them. If it is possible
to spare his enemy, if he believes they can be brought to justice rather
than death, he will do so, but he will also strike as he must to defend
himself.
~
