&04A fury eyed warrior gives impression of barely leashed skill.&00
~
Exengor suffered much at the hands of the callous.  Thirsting for
vengeance yet able to restrain her desire to eradicate evil, she has become
one of the Autumn Sage's most feared warriors. Inspired by the Sage's
serenity, she shows much gentleness off the battlefield, but when her
weapon lies in her hands, she cannot be trusted to deal subtly.
~
