J C 0~
bard artificer Camlyrr~
&12Camlyrr&00~
&12The bard and artificer Camlyrr hums a tune softly, even in midst of battle.&00
~
Camlyrr has seen too much, and bared too much of her soul, to be anything
more than a serene being.  The soft curve of her russet mouth has brought
her many lovers, all of whom she has left the more peaceful and happy for
her presence, and wistfully but willingly accepted her departure.

Of all those who serve the Autumn Sage, Camlyrr is the most gifted maker of
artifacts.  It is said that her stories and song are  enough to rouse even
inanimate cold stone to service.
~
