&05Irath&00~
&05The lithe form of Irath waits in readiness for action.&00
~
Irath was once caster of dark forces, though he was brought to desire the way
of the Light by the Autumn Sage.  The Sage spirited Irath from the dank cell in
which he rotted, cleansing his heart and soul, that he might turn his
extraordinary knowledge and powers to her goals.  Some more slytongued claim
that their relationship is more than a professional one, though no true signs
have ever been seen to that effect.    
~
